Package: peeraffect
Title: Peer Effects in Affect on Team Networks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Swagatam", "Sinha", , "swagatam.sinha11@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-8798-4076"))
Description: A single R package to study peer effects in affect or sentiment diffusion over networks. Implements sentiment scores
    derived from text in repeated person-by-team-by-period data. The package
    builds exclusive peer means and lags, detects team-level affect
    outbursts, constructs intransitive triads of teams that share exactly one
    person, and wraps fixed-effects and peer-of-peer instrumental-variable
    estimators from 'fixest'. It builds on the outburst-based design in
    Sinha (2022) DOI: https://doi.org/10.5465/AMBPP.2022.10036abstract.
